<title>FRANCE: Lira rise partly corrects fall - Trichet quoted.</title>
<headline>Lira rise partly corrects fall - Trichet quoted.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of France governor Jean-Claude Trichet told parliament's finance committee the recent rise in the lira partly corrected its previous depreciation, according to finance committee minutes released on Thursday.</p>
<p>He also told the committee the dollar still had room to rise against European currencies.</p>
<p>Trichet addresssed the finance committee on Wednesday. He declined any comment on leaving the meeting.</p>
</text>
